  sugar: ['Hidden sugar: bubble tea, soft drinks, condensed-milk coffee', [['p', 'WHO advises keeping free sugars under 10% of energy (ideally <5%, about 25 g/day). One bubble tea can contain 30–50 g of sugar and 350–500 kcal.'], ['li', ['Order 30% sugar or no sugar, skip the pearls.', 'Condensed-milk coffee → less milk, or a less-sweet bạc xỉu.', 'Carry your own water bottle.']]]],
